            "rdfs:comment": "This reference organ, Pancreas-female (https://humanatlas.io/3d-reference-library) was created using data from the\nVisible Human Dataset, provided by the National Library of Medicine (Spitzer and Whitlock 2002). In version v1.3,\nadjustments were made from the previous version to make the neck region smaller, and the body and tail regions more\nequal in length.\n\n**Bibliography:**\n\n* Spitzer, Victor M., and David G. Whitlock. 2002. “The Visible Human Dataset: The Anatomical Platform for Human Simulation.” *The Anatomical Record* 253 (2): 49–57. https://doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-0185(199804)253:2<49::AID-AR8>3.0.CO;2-9.",
